ents": 9, "score_up": 75, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"twitter": {"quotedTweet": false, "images": false, "linkEmbed": false, "replies": 16, "created": 1793766194000, "id": "2117835033583165689", "video": false, "poll": false, "user": {"profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2055725271777517568/aTvQ8Ep5_normal.jpg", "displayName": "Nate", "username": "ThePiperPie"}, "content": "I don't know what lesson the right will take from tonight.\n\nBut the left learned that killing us works.\n\nGodspeed.", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 1248}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToYvIDkP", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 39, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8921691, "raw_content": "Abbott lets in Indians and slow walked being part of stopping flow of illegals across his own border - only for all of it to contribute to him losing\n\nLee does nothing to get rid of Thune - when he should have need doing everything in his power \n\nWe couldn\u2019t get a simple majority to pass SAVE act - nothing was forced to make it happen\n\nEvery tool at our disposal wasn\u2019t used to stop fraud - an independent YouTube journalist does all the work and we can\u2019t do better than him ?\n\nWas this Iran war worth it - why not wait till after mid terms to start this and get us our cheap gas first. If you don\u2019t win midterms then you don\u2019t start it\n\nPittance of illegals deported - why is that. In fact a majority self deported . Didn\u2019t go nuclear on their return but you do start a war in Iran \n\nLosing Texas basically loses any chance for a future republican president - why did admin not put a stop to Abbotts weak efforts and actually support him\n\nWhy didn\u2019t admin address crooked judges like Bukele pointed out ? Now it never happens basically\n\n